sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Orchestrator
    participant N as Node app
    participant LB as Load balancer
    participant D as DB and queues
    K->>N: SIGTERM
    N->>LB: readiness fails, no new traffic
    Note over N: server.close(), closeIdleConnections()
    Note over N: wait for in-flight requests
    N->>D: close pools, flush logs
    N->>K: exit(0)
    K->>N: SIGKILL if grace period expires
